    "extraction_notes": [
      "The BAV21W table specifies maximum VF = 1.0 V at 0.1 A and 1.25 V at 0.2 A, maximum IR = 0.1 microA at VR = 200 V and Ta = 25 degC, CT = 5 pF at zero bias and 1 MHz, and trr = 50 ns under IF = IR = 10 mA, Irr = 0.1 x IR, RL = 100 ohm.",
